ÿØÿÛ«symbol Lag-compensator
  «type: X»
  «description: Lag Compensator (s+z)/(s+p) where z>p - improve steady state error (ramp input tracking)»
  «library file: |.subckt Lag-compensator err ctrl\nB1 ctrl 0 V=V(err) Laplace=A*(s+2*pi*fz)/(s+2*pi*fp) IC=IC\n.param A=1\n.param fp=100\n.param fz=10K\n.param IC=0\n.param Verbose=1\n.param type=if(fp>fz,1,0)\n.if (Verbose)\n.if (type)\n.display WARNING!! lead-compensator as fz<fp ('fz'<'fp') : C(s)='A'*(s+'2*pi*fz')/(s+'2*pi*fp')\n.else\n.display lag-compensator as fz>fp ('fz'>'fp') : C(s)='A'*(s+'2*pi*fz')/(s+'2*pi*fp')\n.endif\n.endif\n.ends Lag-compensator»
  «shorted pins: false»
  «line (-300,200) (-150,200) 0 0 0xffa0a1 -1 -1»
  «line (-150,200) (150,-200) 0 0 0xffa0a1 -1 -1»
